    "created_at": "2020-05-17T22:28:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-17T22:29:20Z",
    "body": "When running `cd`, Nu will run this code:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/nushell/nushell/blob/master/crates/nu-cli/src/shell/filesystem_shell.rs#L646-L660\r\n\r\nWhich will check to see if it can be used, then call `std::env::set_current_dir(&path);`\r\n\r\nIt does not currently update the PWD environment variable, though we could add that if it's helpful.\r\n\r\nHere's the default config we give starship:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/nushell/nushell/blob/master/crates/nu-cli/src/cli.rs#L212-L225\r\n\r\nAlso, thanks @jeanga! Much appreciated :)",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
